  whostalking: Haru?
  dialogText:
  - "\u201CYou don\u2019t just\u2026 keep a locked phone and\u2014 and pretend you
    know someone.\""
  - You hear something that might be her talking to somebody else while covering
    the speaker...
  - ... or some papers rustling in the wind.
