  dialogText:
  - 'Your own phone lies dead in your hands. You didn''t even turn on the alarm. '
  - 'It''s sunday in the early afternoon and somewhere in your room a phone is vibrating. '
  - It's not yours...
  - <!!!>
  - 'You scramble through your sheets to get to Harus phone as quickly as possible. '
  - The phone screen shows you're being called by <Kiera>
  - You pick up and hold the phone to your ear.
